.* SAVE: the task menu for saving.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='SAVE'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SAVE HELP=HLPSAVE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Save
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Save Data
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.Files
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB'.Libraries
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO'.Documents and folders
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJTYPE(*PGM)'.Programs
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ'.Other objects
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SAVCHGOBJ'.Changed objects only
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLICPGM'.Licensed programs
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?SAVSECDTA'.Security data
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?SAVCFG'.Configuration
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?SAV'.Objects in directories
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save System and User Data
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD ?CHGBCKUP'.Define save system and user data defaults
:MENUI OPTION=21 ACTION='CMD ?SAVSYS'.Entire system
:MENUI OPTION=22 ACTION='CMD ?SAVSYS'.System data only
:MENUI OPTION=23 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*ALLUSR)'.All user data
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save Document Library Objects
:MENUI OPTION=30 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*ALL)'.All documents, folders, and mail
:MENUI OPTION=31 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*CHG)'.New and changed documents, new folders, all mail
:MENUI OPTION=32 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO'.Documents and folders
:MENUI OPTION=33 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO DLO(*MAIL)'.Mail only
:MENUI OPTION=34 ACTION='CMD ?SAVDLO'.
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save Libraries
:MENUI OPTION=40 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*NONSYS)'.All libraries other than system library
:MENUI OPTION=41 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*IBM)'.All IBM libraries other than system library
:MENUI OPTION=42 ACTION='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(*ALLUSR)'.All user libraries
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Save for Different Systems
:MENUI OPTION=50 ACTION='MENU SAVS36FMT'.Save in System/36 format
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDSAV'.Related commands
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSAVE.Save - Help
:P.Copying objects to media so they can be restored later, one kind at a
time or the whole system. Prompted options show what will be saved
before it starts.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
